@baseUrl = http://localhost:5180
@externalRef = TRX-1001
@accountId = ACC-001

### Initial trade
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/trades
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: assessment-demo

{
  "external_ref": "{{externalRef}}",
  "account_id": "{{accountId}}",
  "instrument": { "isin": "US0378331005" },
  "side": "BUY",
  "quantity": 120,
  "price": 185.40,
  "trade_date": "2025-03-01",
  "as_of": "2025-03-01T10:15:00Z"
}

### Exact duplicate - repeat after initial trade
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/trades
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "external_ref": "{{externalRef}}",
  "account_id": "{{accountId}}",
  "instrument": { "isin": "US0378331005" },
  "side": "BUY",
  "quantity": 120,
  "price": 185.40,
  "trade_date": "2025-03-01",
  "as_of": "2025-03-01T10:15:00Z"
}

### Later correction
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/trades
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "external_ref": "{{externalRef}}",
  "account_id": "{{accountId}}",
