### Accepted-event audit trail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/trades/{{externalRef}}/events

### Corrected USD snapshot
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/portfolios/{{accountId}}/snapshots/2025-03-01

### Readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready
